>\n        <path d=\"M24 10.5 C22.2 8 18 9 18 12.3 C18 14.8 21.2 16.6 24 18.5 C26.8 16.6 30 14.8 30 12.3 C30 9 25.8 8 24 10.5 Z\" fill=\"var(--k)\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </span>\n    <p>Si avvicina per baciarti e non giri più la guancia.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <span class=\"ico\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M13 31 a11 11 0 0 1 22 0 Z\" fill=\"var(--f)\"/>\n        <path d=\"M6 31 H42\" stroke=\"var(--k)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <path d=\"M24 12.5 V8.5\" stroke=\"var(--k)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <path d=\"M13.5 17 L10.8 14.3\" stroke=\"var(--k)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <path d=\"M34.5 17 L37.2 14.3\" stroke=\"var(--k)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <path d=\"M38 24.5 H41\" stroke=\"var(--k)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <path d=\"M7 24.5 H10\" stroke=\"var(--k)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </span>\n    <p>Ti svegli e la bocca è già pulita, non il primo problema della giornata.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>"
