        "remove_vertical_spacing": false,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": false,
        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  FREOS — Sezione \"Voci reali\" (section Custom Liquid pleine largeur, à placer sous la zone d'achat / avant la FAQ)\n  Responsive, sans dépendance, CSS + JS inclus, tout est scopé .frv\n\n  FORMAT (une ligne = une carte, séparées par @@) :\n  Titolo ~~ Testo ~~ Etichetta ~~ Mi piace (nombre, facultatif) ~~ Stelle (1-5, facultatif) ~~ Verificato (0/1) ~~ URL immagine (facultatif) ~~ URL fonte (facultatif)\n\n  - Sans image : la carte affiche le nombre de \"mi piace\" en grand (ou des guillemets si pas de nombre).\n  - Verificato = 1 UNIQUEMENT pour un vrai acheteur vérifié. Stelle : seulement pour de vrais avis clients.\n  - show_links : true = lien \"Vedi il video\" vers la source de chaque commentaire (vérifiable, mais fait sortir du site).\n  - Les \"mi piace\" sont ceux relevés sur TikTok au moment de ta collecte de données.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign autoplay = true -%}\n{%- assign show_links = false -%}\n{%- assign show_total = true -%}\n{%- assign eyebrow = 'Voci reali' -%}\n{%- assign cta_text = 'Prova FREOS' -%}\n{%- assign guarantee_text = '30 giorni soddisfatti o rimborsati' -%}\n\n{%- capture cards_raw -%}\nLa mano davanti alla bocca ~~ Quindi non sono matta che quando parlo troppo vicino alla gente mi viene in automatico mettere la mano davanti ~~ Commento su TikTok ~~ 8081 ~~ ~~ 0 ~~ ~~ https://www.tiktok.com/@luigigrosu/video/7509675562781150487 @@\n5 pacchetti di gomme in borsa ~~ ecco perché cammino con 5/6 pacchetti di gomme/caramelle perché ho questa fobia dell'alito ~~ Commento su TikTok ~~ 6324 ~~ ~~ 0 ~~ ~~ https://www.tiktok.com/@zrossana/video/7558920217502518550 @@\n3.000 volte al giorno ~~ sento gli altri puzzare e ho paura di puzzare anche io, nonostante mi lavi i denti 3000 volte al giorno ~~ Commento su TikTok ~~ 3635 ~~ ~~ 0 ~~ ~~ https://www.tiktok.com/@luigigrosu/video/7509675562781150487 @@\nIl terrore di parlare da vicino ~~ non avete capito io ho il TERRORE di parlare troppo vicino alle persone ~~ Commento su TikTok ~~ 1482 ~~ ~~ 0 ~~ ~~ https://www.tiktok.com/@labenny____/video/7067963611980844294 @@\nGuardo le loro facce ~~ io che fisso la gente per vedere le loro espressioni facciali per vedere se puzzo o meno ~~ Commento su TikTok ~~ 816 ~~ ~~ 0 ~~ ~~ https://www.tiktok.com/@cocogenge/video/7244522206225550618 @@\nPerché non lo dite? ~~ Dentisti, ma se vedete i calcoli tonsillari, perché NON LO DITE??? ~~ Commento su TikTok ~~ 802 ~~ ~~ 0 ~~ ~~ https://www.tiktok.com/@centrodentaleacilia/video/7667530191719173409 @@\nNiente cena fuori ~~ no raga io se esco con un ragazzo non voglio uscire a mangiare perché dopo mi puzza l'alito.. mc o quel che sia ditemi che non sono l'unica vi prego ~~ Commento su TikTok ~~ 172 ~~ ~~ 0 ~~ ~~ https://www.tiktok.com/@chiaraen/video/7409031733586185504 @@\nE non so perché ~~ io li lavo 3 volte al giorno se non di più a volte ma comunque ho un alito che fa rivoltare anche i morti sotto terra e non so perché ~~ Commento su TikTok ~~ 113 ~~ ~~ 0 ~~ ~~ https://www.tiktok.com/@ci0fecahh/video/7559507518012149014 @@\nAppena sveglia ~~ io ce l'ho la mattina appena sveglia, poi mi lavo i denti e dopo un po' ritorna… ~~ Commento su TikTok ~~ 101 ~~ ~~ 0 ~~ ~~ https://www.tiktok.com/@francescaigienista/video/7107188317816360198 @@\nNessuno che te lo dice ~~ il problema è per i single, non abbiamo nessuno che ci dice che ci puzza il fiato. Ed è veramente difficile capirlo da soli. Io non ci riesco. ~~ Commento su TikTok ~~ 48 ~~ ~~ 0 ~~ ~~ https://www.tiktok.com/@prof.lorenzodrago/video/6925862948418211078 @@\nI soldi spesi in gomme ~~ io ho speso così tanti soldi in cicche che se non le avessi comprato avrei una villa, un pastore tedesco e più di un milione nel conto bancario. ~~ Commento su TikTok ~~ 47 ~~ ~~ 0 ~~ ~~ https://www.tiktok.com/@sonoraoul/video/7624538310081334550\n{%- endcapture -%}\n\n{%- assign use_raw = cards_raw | strip -%}\n{%- if use_raw contains '~~' -%}\n{%- assign cards = use_raw | split: '@@' -%}\n\n{%- assign total = 0 -%}\n{%- assign count = 0 -%}\n{%- for c in cards -%}\n  {%- assign p = c | strip | split: '~~' -%}\n  {%- assign t_ok = p[1] | strip -%}\n  {%- if t_ok != blank -%}\n    {%- assign count = count | plus: 1 -%}\n    {%- assign lk0 = p[3] | strip | plus: 0 -%}\n    {%- assign total = total | plus: lk0 -%}\n  {%- endif -%}\n{%- endfor -%}\n{%- if total >= 1000 -%}\n  {%- assign th = total | divided_by: 1000 -%}\n  {%- assign rem = total | modulo: 1000 | prepend: '000' | slice: -3, 3 -%}\n  {%- assign total_fmt = th | append: '.' | append: rem -%}\n{%- else -%}\n  {%- assign total_fmt = total -%}\n{%- endif -%}\n\n<section class=\"frv\" aria-labelledby=\"frv-title\">\n  <div class=\"frv__wrap frv__head\">\n    <p class=\"frv__eyebrow\">{{ eyebrow }}</p>\n    <h2 class=\"frv__h2\" id=\"frv-title\">Parole vere, <em>lo stesso problema</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"frv__lede\">Cosa scrivono online le persone che convivono con l'alito pesante</p>\n    {%- if show_total and total > 0 -%}\n      <p class=\"frv__chip\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 21s-7.5-4.6-9.6-9.2C.9 8.5 2.6 5 6 5c2 0 3.4 1.1 4 2.3h.1C10.6 6.1 12 5 14 5c3.4 0 5.1 3.500 3.600 6.800C19.500 16.400 12 21 12 21z\" transform=\"translate(0 .5)\"/></svg>\n        <span><b>{{ total_fmt }}</b> mi piace su questi {{ count }} commenti</span>\n      </p>\n    {%- endif -%}\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"frv__viewport\" data-frv role=\"region\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" aria-label=\"Voci reali\" data-autoplay=\"{{ autoplay }}\">\n    <button class=\"frv__nav frv__nav--prev\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Precedente\" data-frv-prev>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 5l-7 7 7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n\n    <div class=\"frv__rail\" data-frv-rail tabindex=\"0\">\n      {%- for c in cards -%}\n        {%- assign p = c | strip | split: '~~' -%}\n        {%- assign c_title = p[0] | strip -%}\n        {%- assign c_text = p[1] | strip -%}\n        {%- assign c_label = p[2] | strip -%}\n        {%- assign c_likes = p[3] | strip | plus: 0 -%}\n        {%- assign c_rate = p[4] | strip | plus: 0 -%}\n        {%- assign c_ver = p[5] | strip -%}\n        {%- assign c_img = p[6] | strip -%}\n        {%- assign c_link = p[7] | strip -%}\n        {%- if c_likes >= 1000 -%}\n          {%- assign c_th = c_likes | divided_by: 1000 -%}\n          {%- assign c_rem = c_likes | modulo: 1000 | prepend: '000' | slice: -3, 3 -%}\n          {%- assign c_likes_fmt = c_th | append: '.' | append: c_rem -%}\n        {%- else -%}\n          {%- assign c_likes_fmt = c_likes -%}\n        {%- endif -%}\n        {%- if c_text != blank -%}\n        <article class=\"frv__card\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"{{ forloop.index }} / {{ forloop.length }}\">\n          <div class=\"frv__media\">\n            {%- if c_img != blank -%}\n              <img src=\"{{ c_img }}\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"700\" height=\"440\">\n            {%- else -%}\n              <svg class=\"frv__qmark\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M9.4 6C6.4 6.9 4 9.7 4 13.5V18h6v-6H7.2c.1-2 1.2-3.400 3.200-4L9.400 6zm9 0c-3 .9-5.400 3.700-5.400 7.500V18h6v-6h-2.800c.1-2 1.200-3.400 3.200-4L18.400 6z\"/></svg>\n              {%- if c_likes > 0 -%}\n                <span class=\"frv__num\">{{ c_likes_fmt }}</span>\n                <span class=\"frv__numl\">\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 21s-7.5-4.600-9.600-9.200C.9 8.500 2.600 5 6 5c2 0 3.400 1.100 4 2.300h.1C10.600 6.100 12 5 14 5c3.400 0 5.100 3.500 3.600 6.800C19.500 16.400 12 21 12 21z\" transform=\"translate(0 .5)\"/></svg>\n                  mi piace\n                </span>\n              {%- endif -%}\n            {%- endif -%}\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"frv__body\">\n            {%- if c_rate > 0 -%}\n              <span class=\"frv__stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"{{ c_rate }} su 5\">\n                {%- for s in (1..5) -%}<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"{% if s > c_rate %} class=\"is-off\"{% endif %} aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 2l3.090 6.260L22 9.270l-5 4.870 1.180 6.880L12 17.770l-6.180 3.250L7 14.140 2 9.270l6.910-1.010L12 2z\"/></svg>{%- endfor -%}\n              </span>\n            {%- endif -%}\n            {%- if c_title != blank -%}<h3 class=\"frv__title\">{{ c_title | escape }}</h3>{%- endif -%}\n            <blockquote class=\"frv__quote\">«{{ c_text | escape }}»</blockquote>\n            <div class=\"frv__by\">\n              <span class=\"frv__name\">{{ c_label | escape }}</span>\n              {%- if c_ver == '1' -%}\n                <span class=\"frv__ver\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M7 12.300l3.200 3.200L17 8.800\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.400\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>Cliente verificato</span>\n              {%- endif -%}\n              {%- if show_links and c_link != blank -%}\n                <a class=\"frv__src\" href=\"{{ c_link }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Vedi il video</a>\n              {%- endif -%}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n        {%- endif -%}\n      {%- endfor -%}\n    </div>\n\n    <button class=\"frv__nav frv__nav--next\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Successiva\" data-frv-next>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"frv__dots\" data-frv-dots></div>\n\n  <div class=\"frv__wrap frv__cta\">\n    <a class=\"frv__btn\" href=\"#\" data-frv-cta>{{ cta_text }}\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n    </a>\n    <p class=\"frv__guar\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M7.500 12.400l3 3 6-6.400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.200\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n      {{ guarantee_text }}\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .frv{\n    --frv-green:#1F3D2E; --frv-green2:#3F7A55; --frv-sage:#A8BFA3; --frv-line:#DCE5D8; --frv-ink:#1A1A1A; --frv-body:#4A544D;\n    --frv-gap:16px; --frv-per:1.12;\n    box-sizing:border-box; width:100%; padding:56px 0 64px; margin:0; overflow:hidden;\n    font-family:inherit; color:var(--frv-ink); -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#FFFFFF 0%,#F2F6EF 100%);\n  }\n  .frv *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  .frv__wrap{max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 20px}\n\n  .frv__head{text-align:center; margin-bottom:30px}\n  .frv__eyebrow{margin:0 0 10px; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--frv-green2)}\n  .frv__h2{margin:0 0 10px; padding:0; font-family:inherit; font-size:clamp(28px,6.4vw,44px); font-weight:600; line-height:1.15; letter-spacing:-.01em; text-transform:none; color:var(--frv-green)}\n  .frv__h2 em{font-style:italic; color:var(--frv-green2)}\n  .frv__lede{margin:0 auto; max-width:560px; font-size:clamp(14.5px,3.8vw,17px); line-height:1.5; color:var(--frv-body)}\n  .frv__chip{display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin:18px 0 0; padding:9px 16px; border-radius:999px; background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--frv-line); font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.2; color:var(--frv-green); box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(31,61,46,.06)}\n  .frv__chip svg{flex:none; color:#C6483A}\n  .frv__chip b{font-weight:700}\n\n  .frv__viewport{position:relative; max-width:1240px; margin:0 auto}\n  .frv__rail{\n    display:flex; gap:var(--frv-gap); overflow-x:auto; padding:6px 20px 14px;\n    scroll-snap-type:x mandatory; scroll-padding:0 20px; scrollbar-width:none;\n    -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; overscroll-behavior-x:contain;\n  }\n  .frv__rail::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n  .frv__rail:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--frv-green); outline-offset:-2px; border-radius:12px}\n\n  .frv__card{\n    flex:0 0 calc((100% - (var(--frv-per) - 1) * var(--frv-gap)) / var(--frv-per));\n    min-width:0; scroll-snap-align:start; display:flex; flex-direction:column; margin:0;\n    background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--frv-line); border-radius:18px; overflow:hidden;\n    box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(31,61,46,.05), 0 12px 28px -14px rgba(31,61,46,.18);\n  }\n  .frv__media{\n    position:relative; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:4px;\n    aspect-ratio:16/10; overflow:hidden; text-align:center;\n    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#DDE9D9 0%,#EEF2E6 55%,#F6F3E8 100%);\n  }\n  .frv__media img{position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover}\n  .frv__qmark{position:absolute; left:14px; top:8px; width:64px; height:64px; color:var(--frv-green); opacity:.09}\n  .frv__num{position:relative; font-size:clamp(40px,11vw,58px); font-weight:700; line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.02em; color:var(--frv-green); font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .frv__numl{position:relative; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:13px; font-weight:500; color:var(--frv-green2)}\n  .frv__numl svg{color:#C6483A}\n\n  .frv__body{display:flex; flex:1; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; padding:20px 20px 22px}\n  .frv__stars{display:inline-flex; gap:2px; color:var(--frv-green2)}\n  .frv__stars .is-off{color:rgba(31,61,46,.2)}\n  .frv__title{margin:0; padding:0; font-family:inherit; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.3; letter-spacing:.05em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--frv-green)}\n  .frv__quote{flex:1; margin:0; padding:0; border:0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; font-style:normal; quotes:none; color:var(--frv-ink)}\n  .frv__by{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:4px 12px; padding-top:12px; margin-top:2px; border-top:1px solid var(--frv-line); font-size:13px; line-height:1.3}\n  .frv__name{font-weight:600; color:var(--frv-body)}\n  .frv__ver{display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; color:var(--frv-green2); font-weight:500}\n  .frv__src{margin-left:auto; color:var(--frv-green2); text-decoration:underline; text-underline-offset:2px}\n\n  .frv__nav{\n    position:absolute; top:calc(50% - 20px); z-index:3; display:none; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n    width:46px; height:46px; padding:0; border:1px solid var(--frv-line); border-radius:50%;\n    background:#fff; color:var(--frv-green); cursor:pointer; box-shadow:0 6px 16px -6px rgba(31,61,46,.35);\n    transition:opacity .2s ease, transform .2s ease; appearance:none; -webkit-appearance:none; min-width:0; min-height:0;\n  }\n  .frv__nav--prev{left:8px}\n  .frv__nav--next{right:8px}\n  .frv__nav:hover{transform:scale(1.06)}\n  .frv__nav.is-off{opacity:.35; pointer-events:none}\n  .frv__nav:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--frv-green); outline-offset:2px}\n\n  .frv__dots{display:flex; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin:6px auto 0; padding:0 20px}\n  .frv__dot{width:8px; height:8px; padding:0; border:0; border-radius:50%; background:var(--frv-sage); opacity:.55; cursor:pointer; transition:width .25s ease, opacity .25s ease, background .25s ease; appearance:none; -webkit-appearance:none; min-width:0; min-height:0; position:relative}\n  .frv__dot::after{content:\"\"; position:absolute; inset:-8px}\n  .frv__dot.is-on{width:24px; border-radius:999px; background:var(--frv-green); opacity:1}\n\n  .frv__cta{display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:14px; margin-top:32px; text-align:center}\n  .frv__btn{\n    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:10px; width:100%; max-width:360px; min-height:56px; padding:0 32px;\n    border-radius:12px; background:var(--frv-green); color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase;\n    box-shadow:0 10px 24px -12px rgba(31,61,46,.7); transition:transform .2s ease, background .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;\n  }\n  .frv__btn:hover{background:#17301F; transform:translateY(-1px); box-shadow:0 14px 28px -12px rgba(31,61,46,.75)}\n  .frv__btn:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--frv-sage); outline-offset:3px}\n  .frv__btn svg{flex:none; transition:transform .2s ease}\n  .frv__btn:hover svg{transform:translateX(3px)}\n  .frv__guar{display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin:0; font-size:13.5px; color:var(--frv-body)}\n  .frv__guar svg{flex:none; color:var(--frv-green2)}\n\n  @media (min-width:640px){\n    .frv{--frv-gap:20px; --frv-per:2.15; padding:72px 0 80px}\n    .frv__nav{display:inline-flex}\n    .frv__btn{width:auto}\n  }\n  @media (min-width:1024px){\n    .frv{--frv-per:3; padding:84px 0 96px}\n    .frv__head{margin-bottom:40px}\n    .frv__rail{padding:6px 20px 18px}\n    .frv__nav{width:52px; height:52px}\n    .frv__nav--prev{left:0}\n    .frv__nav--next{right:0}\n    .frv__body{padding:22px 24px 24px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:380px){\n    .frv{--frv-per:1.08}\n    .frv__body{padding:18px 16px 20px}\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n    .frv__nav, .frv__dot, .frv__btn, .frv__btn svg{transition:none}\n    .frv__rail{scroll-behavior:auto}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    var reduce = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-frv]:not([data-frv-ready])').forEach(function (root) {\n      root.setAttribute('data-frv-ready', '');\n      var rail = root.querySelector('[data-frv-rail]');\n      var prev = root.querySelector('[data-frv-prev]');\n      var next = root.querySelector('[data-frv-next]');\n      var dotsBox = root.parentNode.querySelector('[data-frv-dots]');\n      var cards = Array.prototype.slice.call(rail.children);\n      var n = cards.length;\n      var pages = 1, timer = null, hovering = false, raf = null;\n\n      function step() {\n        if (n < 2) return rail.clientWidth;\n        return cards[1].offsetLeft - cards[0].offsetLeft;\n      }\n      function visible() {\n        var s = step();\n        return Math.max(1, Math.round((rail.clientWidth - 40) / s));\n      }\n      function index() {\n        var s = step();\n        return Math.max(0, Math.min(pages - 1, Math.round(rail.scrollLeft / s)));\n      }\n      function go(i) {\n        i = Math.max(0, Math.min(pages - 1, i));\n        rail.scrollTo({ left: i * step(), behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth' });\n      }\n      function buildDots() {\n        pages = Math.max(1, n - visible() + 1);\n        dotsBox.innerHTML = '';\n        if (pages < 2) { dotsBox.style.display = 'none'; return; }\n        dotsBox.style.display = '';\n        for (var i = 0; i < pages; i++) {\n          (function (i) {\n            var b = document.createElement('button');\n            b.type = 'button'; b.className = 'frv__dot';\n            b.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Vai alla voce ' + (i + 1));\n            b.addEventListener('click', function () { stop(); go(i); });\n            dotsBox.appendChild(b);\n          })(i);\n        }\n        update();\n      }\n      function update() {\n        var i = index();\n        var atEnd = rail.scrollLeft + rail.clientWidth >= rail.scrollWidth - 4;\n        if (atEnd) i = pages - 1;\n        Array.prototype.forEach.call(dotsBox.children, function (d, k) { d.classList.toggle('is-on', k === i); });\n        prev.classList.toggle('is-off', rail.scrollLeft <= 4);\n        next.classList.toggle('is-off', atEnd);\n      }\n      function stop() { if (timer) { clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n\n      prev.addEventListener('click', function () { stop(); go(index() - 1); });\n      next.addEventListener('click', function () { stop(); go(index() + 1); });\n      rail.addEventListener('scroll', function () {\n        if (raf) return;\n        raf = requestAnimationFrame(function () { raf = null; update(); });\n      }, { passive: true });\n      rail.addEventListener('touchstart', stop, { passive: true });\n      rail.addEventListener('keydown', stop);\n      window.addEventListener('resize', buildDots);\n\n      buildDots();\n\n      if (root.getAttribute('data-autoplay') === 'true' && !reduce && n > 1) {\n        root.addEventListener('mouseenter', function () { hovering = true; });\n        root.addEventListener('mouseleave', function () { hovering = false; });\n        timer = setInterval(function () {\n          if (hovering || document.hidden) return;\n          var atEnd = rail.scrollLeft + rail.clientWidth >= rail.scrollWidth - 4;\n          go(atEnd ? 0 : index() + 1);\n        }, 5000);\n      }\n    });\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-frv-cta]:not([data-frv-ready])').forEach(function (a) {\n      a.setAttribute('data-frv-ready', '');\n      a.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n        var f = document.querySelector('form[action*=\"/cart/add\"]');\n        if (f) {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          f.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'center' });\n        }\n      });\n    });\n  })();\n</script>\n{%- endif -%}",
